# Game scene / battle

## Ownership

- Orchestration: `game.gd` resolves scenario → `ResourceUtils.update_resource` into live `GameConfig`
- Live `game_config.tres` on the scene = **standalone defaults** (scene must run alone); parent overrides via `ev_start_game` → `initialize(data)`
- States: `GameManager` FSM only (`CountDown` / `Game` / `EndGame`). `CountDownState`: emits `ev_countdown_entered`, starts the plane fly-in deferred unless held (`ev_hold_countdown`), then `ev_countdown_started` (HUD `ui/timed_intro.gd` pops on it); plane hidden while held
- Round: `round/round_controller.gd`, `answer_spawner.gd`, `combat_resolver.gd`
- Questions: `question_generator.gd` (`QuizQuestion`)
- Features: spawn/compose from `src/features/` — keep feature logic inside the feature; scene only wires and reacts to `ev_*`

## Change guide

| Goal | Touch |
|------|--------|
| Win/lose / transitions | FSM states + `FSMGameEvents` |
| Scoring / health | `Player` + `CombatResolver` |
| Streak | `Player.streak` (+1 in `apply_correct`, 0 in `apply_damage`); heal every `GameConfig.streak_heal_every` ≤ `streak_heal_max_health`; HUD `ui/streak_chip.gd` from `streak_feedback_min`; `GameState` emits `ev_streak(n)` / `ev_health_restored` |
| Spawn layout / lanes | `GameArea` + `AnswerSpawner`; window resize → `GameArea.boundary_changed(rect)` → `LineSelector` (plane lanes) + `GameState` (`Answer.refit`, `ev_lanes_changed`) — never cache lane rects / viewport size |
| Question math | `QuizQuestion` + `GameConfig` fields: `_pick_random` retries (`PICK_ATTEMPTS`) until `_fits` (result range, carry, minuend ≥ subtrahend); +/× shown in random order; `RoundController` passes previous `fact_key` → no same example twice in a row; hidden operand `? + 3 = 7` via `missing_operand_chance` gated by `missing_operand_start_progress` (`missing_operand_chance_at(score)`; `RoundController` passes `player.score`) (`_hide_operand` / `_fill_close_options`) |
| Wrong options | +/−: `_generate_close_fake_add_sub` (±1–3, operand ±1, ±10 once two-digit); ×/÷: `_generate_plausible_fake` (table neighbours, ±1–2, ±10, `a+b`; × keeps only within `max(3, correct/2)`; ÷ = quotient ±1–3 + divisor). Never random ranges (kids guess by size) |
| Weak-example review | Every `Question` has `fact_key` (`MathFact`: `add:x:y` covers +/−, `mul:x:y` covers ×/÷). `GameConfig.review_facts` (runtime, from payload `review_facts` set in `game.gd`) + `review_chance`: `_pick_review` re-asks a weighted fact only via allowed ops inside the op's 1st/2nd operand ranges + `_fits` (skips the previous fact). `GameState._report_fact` emits `ev_fact_answered(key, ok)` once per question: wrong **shot** = false, clean correct = true; collisions never count |
| HUD only | `ui/` — listen to `GameEvents`, don't own combat |
| SFX | AppRoot `SfxController` via `GameEvents` (`ev_shoot`, `ev_explosion`, `ev_correct_answer`, `ev_mistake`, `ev_bonus_collected`, `ev_win`, `ev_lose`, state change); plane thrust/crash/whoosh stay on the plane |
| Vibration | AppRoot `VibrationController` via same `GameEvents` (+ `ev_streak` double tick, `ev_health_restored` 3 rising pulses) + `RootEvents` + UI presses; plane crash = long multi-pulse on `ev_lose` |
| Touch plane | `AirPlane`: left half drag = move, right half tap = shoot (`mobile` / web+touchscreen); else arrows + `shoot` (space) or left click (`_unhandled_input` → HUD buttons never shoot). Taps/clicks while the plane isn't processing (countdown) never queue a shot. HUD `ui/touch_hints.gd` (`HUD/TouchHints`, touch scheme only) = visual-only icons (shoot bottom-right presses on `ev_shoot`, dims on `ev_lock_shoot`; move pill bottom-left lights on `AirPlane.has_movement_touch()`); never give them input — zones stay the halves |
| Tutorial | Not in this scene — `scenes/tutorial/` `BattleCoach` talks via `GameEvents` only. Battle exposes: info `ev_answers_spawned(answers, correct, lanes, missing_operand)`, `ev_lanes_changed(lanes)`, `ev_plane_lane_changed(lane, centered)` (`LineSelector`); commands `ev_pause_answers` (`GameState` → `Answer.frozen`), `ev_lock_shoot` (`ShotManager`); `HUD/QuestionAnchor` (`battle.question`). Touch scheme: `AirPlane.is_touch_scheme()` (static) |
| Equipped plane | `PlaneCatalog` + `ProfileController`: planes differ **only** by `speed_mult` (`AirPlane`) and `shot_speed_mult` (`GameState` → `AirPlane.shot_speed_mult` → `ShotManager` scales each shot), + look (`AirPlane.apply_plane(id)`: own atlas frames + tint); never add perks (blast, shield, hint) (isolated F6 → starter) |
| Cosmetics | `game.gd._apply_cosmetics()` (exports `pdata` + `cosmetics` catalog): `AirPlane.apply_paint` / `apply_trail` (trail follows `Nozzle` via `PlaneFlyerTrail.source`; plane sits at the left edge → mostly seen on the win fly-off), `ShotManager.apply_style` (shot tint, explosion tint, ink drips). Visual only — never touch speed / combat |
| Timed level | `GameConfig.time_limit_sec` > 0 (`is_timed()`): `round/battle_time_limit.gd` (`BattleTimeLimit`, paused with `ev_pause_answers`) → `GameEvents.ev_time_left(sec)` → HUD `ui/score.gd` swaps «score / max» for clock icon + «m:ss» (red ≤ `time_warning_sec`); intro `ui/timed_intro.gd` (`HUD/TimedIntro`, in `initable_components`): clock card «Продержись N секунд!» pops during CountDown, flies into the HUD clock on GAME; expiry → `_end_game`. Background paint (`BackgroundBase`, `game_events` forwarded by `BackgroundHost`) follows time, not score: `ev_time_left` → +1 step every `paint_time_step_sec` (5) of elapsed time, full color at 0. `CombatResolver.apply_correct` never wins by count when timed. Correct balloon escaping (`Answer.ev_escaped` → `RoundController.ev_correct_missed`) costs a heart **only when timed** (`ev_mistake`, kill row). `EndGameState`: win = `player.health > 0`. Payload `max_score` = 0 when timed |
| Endless battle | `GameConfig.endless` (menu clock, `menu/endless/endless_game_config.tres`): `round/endless_director.gd` (`EndlessDirector`, paused with `ev_pause_answers`) → `GameEvents.ev_endless_time(sec)` (+ `Player.survived_sec`); every `endless_step_sec` → `GameConfig.apply_endless_stage(step)`: examples from `endless_stages` (21 small steps to 10 min, absolute ranges/ops/`missing_operand_chance`, then the last stays) + `answer_speed` from the curve `endless_speed_start` (50) → `endless_speed_max` (420, fastest plane still crosses all lanes) at `endless_speed_max_sec` (1200), ease-in `endless_speed_curve`. No heart regen (`streak_heal_every` 0); `ev_heart_due` every `endless_heart_every_sec` (300) → `round/heart_controller.gd` spawns `features/answer/heart_balloon.tscn` (`HeartBalloon extends Answer`, `try_collect` before combat like the bonus) only if `health < max` (else wait next due) → +1 heart + `ev_health_restored`; `CombatResolver.apply_correct` never wins / never applies score ramps. Every `endless_boss_every_sec` of balloons → `ev_boss_due` → `BossController.arm()` + `start()` (never rolled from `boss_chance`); no rage phase (`BossAirship.initialize(..., rage_shots 0)` → last plate = fall, else idling in rage would farm time); `ev_defeated` → `ev_boss_defeated` + `release_rounds()` + director clock restarts (battle goes on; `boss_bar.gd` resets on next appear; music back to battle theme). Correct balloon escaping costs a heart (as timed). Ends only at 0 hearts. Runtime `GameConfig.endless_best_sec` (set by `game.gd` from `pdata`) → HUD `ui/endless_record_plate.gd` («НОВЫЙ РЕКОРД!» once, only if a record existed; `initable_components`), `ui/score.gd` clock counts up, background paint one step per stage up to `endless_paint_max` (.75) at `endless_paint_sec` (120), never full. Result payload: `endless_sec`, `endless_best_before`, `is_record` (→ win theme; AppRoot `_apply_endless_record`: +`ENDLESS_RECORD_GOLD` (1) gold + one daily slot via `register_win`, payload `record_gold` → post-battle coin row «+1 за рекорд») |
| Bonus balloon | `round/bonus_controller.gd` (`BonusController`: ≤1 per battle, rolled from `GameConfig.bonus_gold_chance`, spawned on `RoundController.ev_round_started` at a random score in `1..questions_count-2`, random lane, `answer_speed × bonus_gold_speed_mult` ahead of answers) + `features/answer/bonus_balloon.tscn` (`BonusBalloon extends Answer`). `GameState` calls `try_collect` first in shot/ram handlers → never reaches `CombatResolver` (no mistake/correct/stats). Collect → `Player.bonus_gold` + `ev_bonus_collected` (SFX/vibration) → payload `bonus_gold` |
| Miss hint | Wrong shot → correct balloon `show_hint()` for **every** plane (learning aid; never a plane perk) |
| Boss airship | `round/boss_controller.gd` (`BossController`: rolled once from `GameConfig.boss_chance`, armor `boss_armor`; never when timed; endless = `arm()` on schedule) + `features/boss/boss_airship.tscn` (`BossAirship`: 6 editor plate slots, shows an evenly spread subset; star `Spark` flies from popped balloon → plate drops; armor 0 → **rage**: red `sprite_tint`, `Hitbox` (Area2D, group `shot_targets`, layer 5 only while angry) on, creeps left at `rage_speed`, freezes at `rage_stop_x` (never reaches the plane, no damage), takes `GameConfig.boss_rage_hits` shots (`take_shot`) → falls → `ev_destroyed`). Shots: `shot.gd` mask 3+5, non-answer `shot_targets` hit → `ev_target_hit` → `ShotManager` explosion + `GameEvents.ev_target_shot` → `BossController.shoot`. `GameState._on_correct`: last regular answer with boss waiting → `RoundController.hold_rounds()` + `start()` (no win); `ev_ready` → `release_rounds()`; while fighting a correct hit → `on_boss_hit` (streak only, **score stays** = `questions_count`) + `BossController.hit(pos)`; last plate → hold (no more questions; banner `ui/answer_label.gd` shows «Огонь!»), last rage shot → `ev_defeated` → `_end_game`. Wrong answers work as usual. Fight rounds: `GameState._on_answers_spawned` → `BossController.release_answers` → `Answer.launch_from(origin, x)` (entry flies out of the gondola `Hatch` instead of sliding from the right) + `BossAirship.tether(balloon)` (string from `boss_tether.tscn`, snaps at `tether_snap_length` or when the balloon fades). `GameEvents.ev_boss_appeared(armor)` / `ev_boss_hit(left)` / `ev_boss_enraged(hits)` / `ev_boss_shot(left)` / `ev_boss_defeated` → HUD `ui/boss_bar.gd` («ДИРИЖАБЛЬ» + pips from `ui/boss_armor_pip.tscn`; rage → «ЗЛОЙ ДИРИЖАБЛЬ!» + `RageBar`), SFX, vibration |

## Constraints

- Exit battle via `root_events.ev_exit_game` with post-battle payload
- Answers: respect `is_hittable()` during entry tween
- Speed ramp / health / question count come from `GameConfig`, not hardcode
- Prefer small `RefCounted` helpers over growing `GameState` further
- Combat controls/HUD must work on Mobile (touch), Steam (KBM), and HTML — no platform-locked input
